    66	
    67	| Source (repo)                    | Destination (local)                     |
    68	|----------------------------------|-----------------------------------------|
    69	| `skills/security/SKILL.md`      | `~/.claude/skills/sentinel-security/SKILL.md`    |
    70	| `skills/security/agents/*.md`   | `~/.claude/skills/sentinel-security/agents/`     |
